{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2023-02-16 18:04:00', 'title': 'UFP INDUSTRIES SET TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400; OTTER TAIL TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P SMALLCAP 600 CONSTITUENT UFP INDUSTRIES INC. (NASD: UFPI) WILL REPLACE LHC GROUP INC. (NASD: LHCG) IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400, AND OTTER TAIL CORP. (NASD: OTTR) WILL REPLACE UFP INDUSTRIES IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON THURSDAY, FEBRUARY 23. S&P 500 CONSTITUENT UNITEDHEALTH GROUP INC. (NYSE: UNH) IS ACQUIRING LHC GROUP IN A DEAL EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED SOON PENDING FINAL CONDITIONS.'}